  "period_note": "Year-end position from the bank's own FY2016 annual report/audited financial statements, Solo (Union Bank PLC has no subsidiary; Basel-III disclosures show the 'Consolidated' column as blank/not-applicable throughout, and the bank itself states it 'is maintaining Capital to Risk Weighted Assets Ratio (CRAR)... on SOLO basis' -- confirmed in the FY2023 report). Shariah-based Islamic bank throughout its history (incorporated 07 March 2013): reports 'Investments' rather than conventional 'Loans and Advances', and 'Classified Investments' rather than 'NPL', consistent with EXIMBANK/FIRSTSBANK/GIB conventions in this dataset. Source: unionbank-annual-report-2016.txt, own Balance Sheet and Profit and Loss Account (exact Taka, reconciles exactly: balance-sheet identity, PBT-Tax=PAT, Income-Expenditure=Operating Profit) and own 'Details of Capital Fund' note (Tk in Crore). This report's FY2015 comparative column matches unionbank-annual-report-2015.txt for total equity exactly; see FY2015's note for a small ~0.018% total-assets/liabilities presentational difference. CAPITAL DISCREPANCY: this report's own capital note applies a 'Less: Regulatory adjustments (Deferred tax assets)' deduction of BDT 23.2m from Tier 1 (BDT 601.24cr sub-total less 2.32cr = BDT 598.92cr), giving Total Regulatory Capital BDT 677.42cr and CRAR 11.62%; unionbank-annual-report-2017.txt's FY2016 comparative column instead shows Total Tier 1 Capital BDT 601.24cr (i.e. WITHOUT that DTA deduction), Total Regulatory Capital BDT 679.74cr, and CRAR 11.66% -- a ~0.34%/0.04pp difference in presentation convention between the two reports for the identical year. This dataset uses the FY2016 report's own (contemporaneous) figures. Auditor: Syful Shamsul Alam & Co., signed 23 February 2017, unqualified. EPS of 1.80 is this report's own figure; unionbank-annual-report-2017.txt's FY2016 comparative shows a retrospectively bonus-adjusted EPS of 1.61 (paid-up capital rose from BDT 4,708.0m to BDT 5,272.96m during FY2017), the same BAS-33 pattern as FY2015/2016.",
